  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Humans control each real paddle independently. Whole controller: LB/RB
    paddle sides, RT/LT set forward/backstroke power and left stick carves/leans.
    Keyboard or split stick: left/right choose a paddle, up/down set direction, centered
    sides plus up/down stroke both. Steering with a single paddle turns away from
    that side. ACTION rolls or rights an inverted kayak. Whitewater Race follows
    the full river to the finish. Slalom adds a physical fork: orange log shortcut
    or green shallow channel. Missing both branch gates costs three seconds; ordinary
    gate and collision penalties also apply. Freestyle: tap ACTION in the air for
    a roll, then hold ACTION to brace toward a controlled landing; tricks score only
    after physical landing. Survival: three capsizes retire you. After the first
    descent, circle the lower rapids without attempting an impossible climb back
    up a waterfall. Currents/waves intensify over time. AI paddles, rolls, braces
    and recovers through the same forces.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
